Package: dell-rugged-7404
Version: 1.3.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, alsa-utils, udev, systemd, zenity, python3-tk, gpsd, gpsd-clients, pciutils, policykit-1 | polkitd
Maintainer: afrelund <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Linux fixes for Dell Latitude 14 Rugged Extreme (7404)
 Touchscreen (eGalax 0eef:0001) classification/autosuspend repair and
 built-in speaker routing workaround, u-blox GPS (gpsd) attachment, GPU
 driver check, a GPS monitor app (sky view, UTM/MGRS, GPS time, jamming),
 and a setup window plus terminal status/install tool.
 Tested on Ubuntu 26.04 LTS.
 Only for the Latitude 14 Rugged Extreme (7404).
